    <briefdescription>
<para>The body of a static suite written for v5.0.1, whose first parameter is a <computeroutput>static_suite&amp;</computeroutput> reference. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Satisfied by a callable that cannot be invoked with a <computeroutput>suite&amp;</computeroutput> reference, but can be invoked with a <computeroutput>static_suite&amp;</computeroutput> one, followed by the arguments as stored (decayed, non-<computeroutput>const</computeroutput> lvalues). It selects the deprecated constructor of <computeroutput>static_suite</computeroutput>; the callables that accept a <computeroutput>suite&amp;</computeroutput> reference, including the generic lambdas, do not satisfy it.</para>
